al":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**CPack: The -DX_VCPKG_APPLOCAL_DEPS_INSTALL=ON is invalid**\r\n\r\nag: vcpkg is installed openssl\r\n\r\n```\r\nvcpkg install openssl\r\n```\r\n\r\nUse the CMAKE install command to install dependent libraries(libcrypto-3-x64.dll,libssl-3-x64.dll).\r\n\r\n```\r\ngit clone https://github.com/KangLin/RabbitCommon.git\r\nmkdir build\r\ncd build\r\ncmake ..  -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=install  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release ^\r\n              -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=${{env.VCPKG_ROOT}}/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake ^\r\n              -DVCPKG_VERBOSE=ON ^\r\n              -DX_VCPKG_APPLOCAL_DEPS_INSTALL=ON\r\ncmake --build . --config Release --target install\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut use the **CPack** command to is not install dependent libraries(libcrypto-3-x64.dll,libssl-3-x64.dll).\r\n\r\n```\r\ngit clone https://github.com/KangLin/RabbitCommon.git\r\nmkdir build\r\ncd build\r\ncmake ..  -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=install  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release ^\r\n              -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=${{env.VCPKG_ROOT}}/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake ^\r\n              -DVCPKG_VERBOSE=ON ^\r\n              -DX_VCPKG_APPLOCAL_DEPS_INSTALL=ON\r\ncmake --build . --config Release --target package\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Environment**\r\n- OS: [Windows]\r\n- Compiler: MSVC\r\n\r\n@autoantwort @strega-nil @sandercox @crud89 @dhrdlicka @Be-ing ","closed_by":{"login":"BillyONeal","id":1544943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDQ5NDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1544943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal","html_url":"https://github.com/BillyONeal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyON